{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《愛．回家之開心速遞》陪伴觀眾多年，如今劇集即將接近尾聲。除了幕前演員為大家帶來的精彩演出外，背後一班默默付出的幕後功臣更是功不可沒，正因為有他們的努力，才能創作出接近 3000 集的動人故事。</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">呂慧儀（飾演熊若水）日前在社交平台上載了與編劇組的合照，並撰寫長文，感激這班幕後功臣多年來的用心與「腦力」。她坦言，一直不知道編劇們的「腦洞」到底有多大，竟然能構思出接近 3000 集的豐富劇情。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2932d230-9722-4a67-83a5-4c5b8b9aec81.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026EFp0WyoEDR1784107028.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2932d230-9722-4a67-83a5-4c5b8b9aec81.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"7dea7d3a-d574-4cc0-8171-6c92a3ffb7ef.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026pXoaBhxk8n1784107034.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"7dea7d3a-d574-4cc0-8171-6c92a3ffb7ef.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">她憶述在電視城日常拍攝的點滴：「他們總是躲在編劇房裏奮鬥，有時剛巧上去拎劇本經過，會聽到噼噼啪啪的打字聲，也有時會聽到他們哈哈大笑的聲音。」正因為這份熱情，才誕生了一份份搞笑、感人又搞怪的劇本。呂慧儀笑言，自己就像小粉絲一樣，每次有新劇本推出都會滿懷期待地追著看，不知不覺間便看完了這部長篇巨製。</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">在帖文中，呂慧儀特意上載了一張寫滿編審與編劇名字的圖片（圖三），感性地表示這些名字都值得被大眾記下來。她寫道：「謝謝你們創下如此佳績，也謝謝你們的『腦力』陪伴了我好多好多個晚上。這邊畢業了，期待你們在新的崗位上繼續加油！」</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">此外，適逢近日為 DSE 放榜日，呂慧儀在文末亦不忘溫暖地勉勵一眾應屆考生。她向學生們送上祝福：「無論結果如何，曾經付出的努力也值得被擁抱。祝大家順利考到好成績。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-21T01:07:21.198023+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":540,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}